00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,750
Meta unga website-ah crawl pannuma?

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:05,750
Meta-voda pudhu business terms: Meta crawler unga website-ku vandhu product details edukka permission.

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:09,250
20 Nov start aaga irundhadhu. 5 Nov-la Meta PAUSE pannidichu.

4
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,750
Ippo pazhaya terms dhaan. Thirumba varalaam, Meta innum date sollala.

5
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:16,750
Ready-ah irunga: crawler rules (robots.txt), clean product pages, unga traffic unga control.

6
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:20,000
Weequb Technologies. Free website check venumaa? "WEBSITE"-nu comment pannunga!
